  ;; ============================================================
  ;; TEXT ANNOTATIONS
  ;; ============================================================
  (text "ETHERNET 10/100 DESIGN (Rev 1.1 - W5500)\n\nController: W5500 (WIZnet) - QFN-48\n- Hardwired TCP/IP stack (no lwIP needed!)\n- Integrated 10/100 MAC + PHY\n- SPI interface up to 80MHz (SPI4 on STM32)\n- 8 simultaneous hardware sockets\n- 32KB internal TX/RX buffer\n- Industrial temp: -40 to +85C\n- Own 25MHz crystal (independent of MCU HSE)\n\nAdvantages over LAN8742A (PHY-only):\n- Only 4 SPI pins vs 11 RMII pins\n- TCP/IP offloaded from MCU (no lwIP)\n- Simpler firmware, more deterministic\n- Sufficient for Modbus TCP, MQTT, HTTP\n\nMagnetics: J0011D21BNL (RJ45 + integrated magnetics)\nEMI: Ferrite beads (BLM18PG121SN1D) on all TX/RX pairs\nESD: PESD5V0S2BT on data lines\n\nSPI4 Pin Assignment:\n- PE2: SPI4_SCK\n- PE5: SPI4_MISO\n- PE6: SPI4_MOSI\n- PE4: W5500_CS_N\n- PE3: W5500_RST_N\n- PB0: W5500_INT_N"
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 25.4 25.4 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "ETH-TEXT-0001")
  )
